1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:22,280
Hello, I'm Park Jin-beom, who is working on visual creative in the name of TAGIREN.

2
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:27,120
Recently, I worked on a girl group aespa's We Flash album i-aespa character artwork.

3
00:00:27,120 --> 00:00:30,640
Hi, I'm Yon Sanchez, a digital fashion creator and 3D artist.

4
00:00:30,640 --> 00:00:34,520
My work focuses on creating realistic and visual-friendly clothes.

5
00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:37,520
I worked with Jin-beom on the We Flash Universe project.

6
00:00:39,120 --> 00:00:41,679
Two years ago, while preparing for an online lecture,

7
00:00:41,679 --> 00:00:48,439
I wanted to explain to the students how to make clothes and how to use existing asset clothes.

8
00:00:48,439 --> 00:00:50,920
At that time, I was looking for assets to use.

9
00:00:50,920 --> 00:00:55,880
At that time, Yon had a lot of professionally and systematically produced clothes,

10
00:00:55,880 --> 00:00:57,079
so based on Yon's clothes,

11
00:00:57,079 --> 00:01:00,039
I wanted to explain how to customize them to the students.

12
00:01:00,039 --> 00:01:02,719
That's when I got in touch with Yon.

13
00:01:02,719 --> 00:01:04,599
I think that's when we became friends.

14
00:01:04,599 --> 00:01:06,439
I looked at Jin-beom's Instagram and thought,

15
00:01:06,439 --> 00:01:08,439
Okay, this person knows what she's doing.

16
00:01:08,439 --> 00:01:09,560
I love her style.

17
00:01:09,560 --> 00:01:10,799
I want to work with her.

18
00:01:10,799 --> 00:01:15,799
I-aespa's character artwork was uploaded to my SNS on SM Entertainment.

19
00:01:15,799 --> 00:01:19,719
I saw the previous character artwork and thankfully, he contacted me about the artwork.

20
00:01:23,719 --> 00:01:26,079
I think it was really good at the time.

21
00:01:26,079 --> 00:01:28,200
I always tried to recreate the style I had been looking for.

22
00:01:28,200 --> 00:01:33,599
I gave him a good chance to redesign the character and design the outfit.

23
00:01:33,599 --> 00:01:37,679
I had a lot of fun working on it and it was a meaningful project.

24
00:01:37,679 --> 00:01:40,239
At that time, I was in touch with Yon.

25
00:01:40,239 --> 00:01:42,239
I know Yon's excellent skills,

26
00:01:42,239 --> 00:01:46,359
so I asked him to work with me on the outfit for I-aespa.

27
00:01:46,359 --> 00:01:50,079
Jin-beom sent me a direct message asking me about this collaboration.

28
00:01:50,079 --> 00:01:51,480
Without thinking too much, I said,

29
00:01:51,480 --> 00:01:52,719
Let's go ahead with it.

30
00:01:52,719 --> 00:01:53,759
We connected very quickly.

31
00:01:53,759 --> 00:01:55,359
It was very natural.

32
00:01:56,079 --> 00:01:57,640
It can't be better than this.

33
00:02:02,599 --> 00:02:04,159
Collaborating together has been very fluid.

34
00:02:04,159 --> 00:02:06,039
We actively share connections,

35
00:02:06,039 --> 00:02:09,400
we give mutual feedback and we help each other a lot.

36
00:02:09,400 --> 00:02:11,719
The project had a clear line from the beginning.

37
00:02:11,719 --> 00:02:12,919
The process was very fluid.

38
00:02:12,919 --> 00:02:15,919
I quickly made the basic structure and then added the details.

39
00:02:17,039 --> 00:02:20,159
Yon and I had worked on a collaboration several times before,

40
00:02:20,159 --> 00:02:21,680
and thanks to this project,

41
00:02:21,680 --> 00:02:25,280
we were able to quickly proceed with the project with smooth communication.

42
00:02:26,080 --> 00:02:28,880
Thanks to the collaboration between Clou and Marvellous Designer,

43
00:02:28,880 --> 00:02:31,600
I think we can work faster and more easily.

44
00:02:31,600 --> 00:02:33,800
Especially using Marvellous Designer,

45
00:02:33,800 --> 00:02:37,640
we can spend more time on concepts and level of detail,

46
00:02:37,640 --> 00:02:40,120
so we were able to create a high-quality artwork.

47
00:02:40,120 --> 00:02:43,040
We were also able to work more effectively and efficiently

48
00:02:43,040 --> 00:02:47,480
because we collaborate and communicate using Clou and Marvellous Designer.

49
00:02:47,480 --> 00:02:49,320
And since the files are compatible,

50
00:02:49,320 --> 00:02:51,760
it's much easier to review them.

51
00:02:56,080 --> 00:03:01,800
I have been working with other K-pop artists since IESPA's Reflash Universe project.

52
00:03:01,800 --> 00:03:06,320
I want to have a career in the game industry as well as fashion or entertainment,

53
00:03:06,320 --> 00:03:09,560
but my ultimate goal is to become a 3D artist in various industries,

54
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:13,240
especially as a 3D character artist.

55
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:15,480
I loved working on the IESPA project.

56
00:03:15,480 --> 00:03:18,960
It opened many doors for me to different projects with fashion brands,

57
00:03:18,960 --> 00:03:22,560
the automotive industry, and projects where you can always learn something new.

58
00:03:22,560 --> 00:03:25,880
As a dream, I would like to create my own fashion brand.

59
00:03:26,080 --> 00:03:30,320
But it's a long-term dream, so I'm not in a hurry to do it.

60
00:03:30,320 --> 00:03:33,120
I need to keep learning, exploring, meeting people,

61
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:35,320
and keeping myself informed about trends.

62
00:03:37,640 --> 00:03:39,960
Clou is an essential part of my work.

63
00:03:39,960 --> 00:03:41,920
I would say it's my daily life.

64
00:03:41,920 --> 00:03:45,520
Thanks to this, I can experiment digitally with different forms.

65
00:03:45,520 --> 00:03:47,960
I hope to show you my new projects.

66
00:03:47,960 --> 00:03:51,040
Right now, I'm mainly dealing with Marvellous Designer,

67
00:03:51,040 --> 00:03:54,640
and I know that the compatibility between Clou and Marvellous Designer software

68
00:03:54,640 --> 00:03:55,840
is really good.

69
00:03:56,080 --> 00:03:58,640
For my目標 and the goal I set,

70
00:03:58,640 --> 00:04:00,680
it's a tool a Marvellous Designer needs to be able to achieve,

71
00:04:00,680 --> 00:04:04,160
so I'm going to keep using it for my career.

72
00:04:04,160 --> 00:04:05,920
I'm planning to keep it up.

